+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+Nothing is recorded in this project regarding a policy for TLS certificate verification in development builds. The only related usage found in the repository is `InsecureSkipVerify: true` applied locally within test helpers (`gin_test.go`, `gin_integration_test.go`) to work around `x509: certificate signed by unknown authority` errors against self-signed certificates used in those tests; this is not a documented project decision governing TLS verification behavior in development builds generally.
